1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:06,500
Nature speaks in waves. We translate it.

2
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:12,600
You can't see the air. But you can understand it.

3
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:17,600
CHAAK feels the wind and the rain…

4
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,800
…and SMAA wakes up…

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,600
…to breathe the air.

6
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:31,400
A laser counts every particle that crosses its beam.

7
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,600
Gases react on electrodes and become current.

8
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:41,400
Every pulse becomes a measurement…

9
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:46,400
…and every measurement, open data.

10
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:54,200
That's how it reaches AIreGPT, so you know what to do.
